un](https://www.rathiglobalrealty.com/property-for-sale-in-dehradun)   [Bhubaneswar](https://www.rathiglobalrealty.com/property-for-sale-in-bhubaneswar)   [Patna](https://www.rathiglobalrealty.com/property-for-sale-in-patna)   [Allahabad](https://www.rathiglobalrealty.com/property-for-sale-in-allahabad)   [Bhopal](https://www.rathiglobalrealty.com/property-for-sale-in-bhopal)   [Nuh](https://www.rathiglobalrealty.com/property-for-sale-in-nuh)   [Haridwar](https://www.rathiglobalrealty.com/property-for-sale-in-haridwar)   [Hapur](https://www.rathiglobalrealty.com/property-for-sale-in-hapur)   [Guwahati](https://www.rathiglobalrealty.com/property-for-sale-in-guwahati)   [Jhajjar](https://www.rathiglobalrealty.com/property-for-sale-in-jhajjar)\n\n![Rathi Global Realty](https://www.rathiglobalrealty.com/uploads/logo/1777987165-logo-gold.png)\n\nSign In / Register\n\nEnter your name and mobile number to continue\n\n* [Home](https://www.rathiglobalrealty.com/)\n* [Property in Mumbai](https://www.rathiglobalrealty.com/property-for-sale-in-mumbai)\n* [Flats in Mumbai](https://www.rathiglobalrealty.com/flats-for-sale-in-mumbai)\n* [Flats in Borivali West](https://www.rathiglobalrealty.com/flats-for-sale-in-borivali-west-mumbai)\n* [2 BHK Flats in Borivali West](https://www.rathiglobalrealty.com/2-bhk-flats-for-sale-in-borivali-west-mumbai)\n* Mayfair Shyam\n\n![Mayfair Housing logo](https://www.rathiglobalrealty.com/uploads/product/mayfair-housing-585.jpg)\n\n# Mayfair Shyam Borivali West, Mumbai\n\n[See on Map](https://www.google.com/maps/search/Borivali+West%2C+Mumbai)\n\n₹1.60 Cr\\* - ₹2.27 Cr\\*\n\nUpdated 10 Jul 2026 |\n\nRERA Approved\n\nRERA Details\n\n![](https://www.rathiglobalrealty.com/front_assets/assets/img/videoimg.webp)\n\nReady To Move\n\n![](https://www.rathiglobalrealty.com/front_assets/assets/img/videoimg.webp)\n\nReady To Move\n\n2, 3 BHK Flats\n\nProject Type\n\nPossession Date\n\nTotal Units\n\n39 Units\n\nLand Area\n\n0.74 Acres\n\nProject Status\n\nReady To Move\n\nRera Status\n\nRegistered\n\nWhy you should consider Mayfair Shyam?\n\n* Architectural excellence and living at Mayfair Shyam.\n* Prime location in Borivali West, Mumbai.\n* A highly lucrative Ready To Move investment in Borivali West, Mumbai.\n\n[About](#sec-overview) [Project Highlights](#sec-details) [Floor Plans](#sec-floorplan) [Photos & Videos](#sec-photos) [Amenities](#sec-amenities) [RERA Details](#sec-rera) [Map & Location](#sec-map) [About Developer](#sec-developer) [Similar Projects](#sec-similar)\n\n## About Mayfair Shyam\n\n![Rathi Global Realty](https://www.rathiglobalrealty.com/front_assets/assets/psweb/images/why-consider-badge.svg)\n\nMayfair Shyam is a residential project by Mayfair Housing, located in the prestigious Borivali West, Mumbai. Designed as a Apartment, the project offers spacious and thoughtfully crafted 2, 3 BHK Flats residences tailored for modern living. It is currently in the Ready To Move stage with possession expected by N/A. The project reflects world-class planning, superior engineering excellence, and refined luxury living.\n\nExpansively planned over 0.74 Acres, the project offers breathtaking views of the landscaped greens and open spaces. The plush residences range from varied sizes and include thoughtfully designed layouts with 2,3 Bedroom.\n\nFrom the grand entrance lobby to the elegantly designed interiors, every aspect of the project defines sophistication and attention to detail. Residents can enjoy world-class lifestyle amenities such as a grand clubhouse, swimming pool, wellness and fitness centres, landscaped gardens, jogging tracks, sports facilities, kids' play areas, and more.\n\nStrategically connected to major roads such as\n\n* **Gokhale Education Society Shishu Vikas Mandir** (School) - 0.2 km\n* **Ganesh Mandir Kastur Park** (Bus Stop) - 0.2 km\n* **Seth Ent & Eye Hospital** (Hospital) - 0.3 km\n\n, the project enjoys excellent connectivity to schools, hospitals, business hubs, and entertainment centres, making it a lucrative residential destination.\n\nThe project is registered under RERA No. A51800000454, ensuring seamless transparency and buyer confidence. Buyers can explore detailed floor plans, project images, specifications, and master layouts through the official brochure and sales gallery. Flexible payment plans are available for both investors and homebuyers. Priced at ₹1.60 Cr–₹2.27 Cr, Mayfair Shyam offers strong potential for long-term appreciation and rental yield due to its premium location, luxury infrastructure, and trusted developer reputation.\n\nWhether you are an end-user looking for an upscale lifestyle or an investor seeking capital appreciation, Mayfair Shyam offers a compelling opportunity in one of Mumbai's fastest-growing luxury corridors.\n\n[+ Read More](javascript:void(0))\n\n## Mayfair Shyam Project Highlights\n\n* Mayfair Shyam is a premium Apartment featuring 2, 3 BHK Flats residences.\n* Situated in the prime locality of Borivali West, Mumbai, offering excellent long-term appreciation.\n* Currently in its Ready To Move phase, aligning perfectly with your investment timeline.\n* Experience seamless day-to-day living at Mayfair Shyam with Power Backup, 24\\*7 Water Supply, Lift.\n* Mayfair Shyam possesses an advanced and multi-tier security system with 24 x 7 Security, CCTV / Video Surveillance.\n\n## Mayfair Shyam Floor Plans\n\n617 sq.ft\n\n874 sq.ft\n\nFloor plan image coming soon\n\nFloor plan image coming soon\n\n2 BHK 617 sq.ft Apartment\n\n3 BHK 874 sq.ft Apartment\n\n## Build Your Ideal Unit\n\nConfiguration\n\nFloor Bond\n\nSelect Facing\n\nYour selection0 Taps\n\n## Mayfair Shyam Photos & Videos\n\nExplore Mayfair Shyam's gallery to see luxury come to life in our stunning interiors, views, and amenities.\n\n## Mayfair Shyam Amenities\n\nMayfair Shyam, located in Borivali West, Mumbai, offers a sophisticatedly created collection of world-class amenities designed to elevate your everyday living. Blending luxury, wellness, and leisure, this iconic residential landmark development features Power Backup, 24\\*7 Water Supply and Lift. Every corner of the property is crafted to deliver tranquility.\n\n![Power Backup](https://www.rathiglobalrealty.com/uploads/amenities/generator.svg)\n\nPower Backup\n\n![24*7 Water Supply](https://www.rathiglobalrealty.com/uploads/amenities/water-supply.svg)\n\n24\\*7 Water Supply\n\n![Lift](https://www.rathiglobalrealty.com/uploads/amenities/elevator.svg)\n\nLift\n\n![24 x 7 Security](https://www.rathiglobalrealty.com/uploads/amenities/security.svg)\n\n24 x 7 Security\n\n![CCTV / Video Surveillance](https://www.rathiglobalrealty.com/uploads/amenities/security-camera.svg)\n\nCCTV / Video Surveillance\n\nKids' Play Areas / Sand Pits\n\n## Mayfair Shyam RERA Details\n\nMayfair Shyam stands as a benchmark for legal transparency and regulatory excellence. Fully approved and registered with the Real Estate Regulatory Authority (RERA), Mayfair Shyam adheres to all government compliance and consumer protection standards. The official registration details are as follows: Mayfair Shyam is registered under RERA with registration number A51800000454. Project registration details and related approvals can be checked through the official RERA portal using the registered number.\n\nRead more\n\nA51800000454\n\n![RERA QR](https://api.qrserver.com/v1/create-qr-code/?size=200x200&data=A51800000454)\n\n## Nearby Landmarks - Mayfair Shyam\n\n## Check Travel Time\n\n![Mayfair Shyam]()\n\nMayfair Shyam\n\nBorivali West\n\n## How does Mayfair Shyam compare with other top projects?\n\nCompare Mayfair Shyam with similar projects. Evaluate pricing, configurations, possession timelines, and project scale to find the best fit for your needs.\n\nNo Image\n\nCurrent Project\n\nMayfair Shyam\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\nPrice₹1.60 Cr\\* - ₹2.27 Cr\\*\n\nPer Sq. FtN/A\n\nConfiguration2, 3 BHK Flats\n\nUnit SizeN/A\n\nPossessionN/A\n\nStatusReady To Move\n\nRERA No.A51800000454\n\n