le Units Available\n\nAbout Project\n\n## MAYFAIR SHYAM\n\n**Mayfair Housing** presents one of the finest residential project in Shimpoli road, Borivali West, Mumbai. The most desired location in today's date. This project is named as \"**Mayfair Shyam**\" which will be structured as 14 Floors Having 3 Apartments per floor with a configurations of 2 BHK, 3 BHK & 3.5 BHK luxuriou\n\ns flats.   \n  \n\nIt offers amenities and facilities such as Fully equipped Fitness centre, Stack car park at the ground level. While on the other hand it provides Raft and Open Footing, R.C.C. Framed Structure & Acrylic paint of Asian Paint thus ensuring your safety and comfort. The location of Mayfair Shyam gives direct access to main road connecting to various other locations in the vicinity.\n\n**For more information on floor plans, brochure, payment plans, resale options and investor flats, please contact us.**\n\n#### A brief about Mayfair Shyam\n\nA very live able and nice residential property Mayfair Shyam is at Borivali West, which is in Mumbai. A project of the property developers called Mayfair Housing, this piece of real estate has extremely life oriented designs and exclusive residential living spaces.\n\n#### Available utilities at Mayfair Shyam\n\nA well crafted project like Mayfair Shyam deserves the best and the most modern amenities. Therefore this property boasts of a score of utilities that are as follows: etc.\n\nCritical Services & Locations Nearby\n\nBeing at Borivali West which is a residential zone, this property also has many other important locations and services close to it like Shimpoli road, Haridas nagar road, Kastur park road, L Bhandari marg & Shimpoli chikuwadi. Services and enterprises like Bank of baroda, Big boss beauty parlour, Nirvana, Suvarna general hospital & Kamla Yamaha etc. are also close to this property.\n\nStructural Brief:\n\nThis beautiful property called Mayfair Shyam is proposed to be a 1 Tower / 14 Floors / 13 Units.\n\n#### Details of Apartments Available\n\nType : Residential Flats   \nPrice : 1.74 Cr Onwards   \nAvailable : 2 BHK, 3 BHK & 3.5 BHK Apartments, 693 Sq.ft To 969 Sq.ft   \nFor Booking Call us : **+919820575619**\n\n}//on;u for residential temp 2 if($res\\_property[0]['propertytypeid'] == 2 && $res\\_property[0]['template'] == 1){ ?>\n\n#### Mayfair Shyam An introduction\n\nMayfair Shyam is a perfect residential property for your business. Strategically located at Shimpoli road, Borivali West this project is a very good residential option at Borivali West, Mumbai. It is a project by Mayfair Housing.\n\n#### Important aspects and features of Mayfair Shyam\n\nApart from quality construction, this residential Project has a host of amenities and facilities especially designed with your business in mind including etc.\n\n#### Areas and Facilities in proximity\n\nBeing located at Borivali West, this project gives your business a lot of advantage. Major roads and landmarks like Shimpoli road, Haridas nagar road, Kastur park road, L Bhandari marg & Shimpoli chikuwadi are extremely close to this project. Other critical facilities and important entities in close proximity include Bank of baroda, Big boss beauty parlour, Nirvana, Suvarna general hospital & Kamla Yamaha etc.\n\n#### Structure Details\n\n1 Tower / 14 Floors / 13 Units\n\n#### Highlights of Mayfair Shyam\n\nType : Residential Flats   \nPrice : 1.74 Cr Onwards   \nAvailable : 2 BHK, 3 BHK & 3.5 BHK Apartments, 693 Sq.ft To 969 Sq.ft\n\n#### Registration Office, Village and CTS details of Mayfair Shyam\n\nType, Area & Price\n\n## Price List\n\n| Type | Size | Price |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2 BHK | 693 | 1.74 CR |\n| 3 BHK | 874 | 2.19 CR |\n| 3.5 BHK | 969 | 2.43 CR |\n\n**Note:** Above Mentioned Sizes and Prices are Approximate, Maintenance, Club Charges, Registration, Stamp duty, Car Parking, etc as applicable. **\\*Rates are indicative.**\n\nAmenities\n\n## Project Amenities\n\n\\* IOD in place  \n\\* Close to Borivali station  \n\\* Close to S.V. road and Link road  \n\\* Only 3 flats per floor. Exclusive 2 and 3BHK flats  \n\\* Superior quality vitrified tiles flooring in each flats  \n\\* Servant toilet on each mid landing floors  \n\\* Direct access to 42,000 Sq.ft. of Civic Federation private park from the complex\n\nSpecifications\n\n## Project Specifications\n\n\\* Raft and Open Footing.  \n\\* R.C.C. Framed Structure.  \n\\* Acrylic paint of Asian Paint  \n\\* Superior quality Vitrified Tiles flooring in living, dining, kitchen, bedrooms and passage area.  \n\\* European WC in all toilets of reputed make.  \n\\* Counter top Wash Basin of reputed make.  \n\\* Single Lever Hot & cold Diverter unit in all the toilets.  \n\\* Main door and bedroom door frames will be of CP teak in Melamine Finish.  \n\\* Designer Ceramic Tiles Dado up to 7ft. height in kitchen.  \n\\* Provision of point for water purifier.  \n\\* Three phase connection.  \n\\* Adequate 5A & 15A switch sockets.  \n\\* Telephone points in all Bedrooms, Living Rooms & Family Rooms.  \n\\* Concealed UPVC / CPVC plumbing with concealed flush tank / flush valve of superior quality.  \n\\* Water Tanks and Water Pumps as per MCGM requirement.  \n\\* Terrace water proofing in China Mosaic tiles over BB coba.\n\nFloor Plans\n\n## Floor Plan\n\n![2 BHK Floor Plan](/floor-plan.jpg)\n\n🔒 Submit enquiry to unlock floor plan\n\nLocation\n\n## Location & Nearby\n\nMap - Shimpoli road, Borivali West, Mumbai\n\n**Address:** Shimpoli road, Borivali West, Mumbai\n\n**Close To:** Shimpoli road, Haridas nagar road, Kastur park road, L Bhandari marg & Shimpoli chikuwadi\n\nFAQ\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions about MAYFAIR SHYAM\n\nWhere is Mayfair Shyam Exactly located?\n\nMayfair Shyam is located at Shimpoli road, Borivali West, .\n\nWhat are unit options available in Mayfair Shyam?\n\nMayfair Shyam offers 2 BHK, 3 BHK & 3.5 BHK Apartments.\n\nWhat is the starting price of Flats in Mayfair Shyam?\n\nThe starting price of Flats at Mayfair 