/mayfair-housing-585.jpg?aio=w-128;h-128;crop;)\n\n# Mayfair Shyam Borivali West, Mumbai\n\n![Mayfair Shyam Cover Image](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/mayfair-shyam-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-725;h-350;crop;)\n![Mayfair Shyam Video](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-mayfair-shyam-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\n**₹1.60 Cr - 2.27 Cr**\n\n₹31,900 Per Sq. Ft.\n\n## Why Invest Through Square Yards?\n\n![Zero brokerage icon](/assets/images/zero-brokerage.svg)\n\n### Zero Brokerage\n\n100% Service, 0% Brokerage\n\n![Lowest price icon](/assets/images/lowest-price.svg)\n\n### Lowest Price Guaranteed\n\nHighly unlikely, but if you find a lower price anywhere, tell us and we will match it.\n\n![Full service support icon](/assets/images/full-service-support.svg)\n\n### Full Service Support\n\nOur sales personnel are accountable for every step.\n\n## About Mayfair Shyam, Borivali West by Mayfair Housing\n\n## Mayfair Shyam Price List, Price Trends and Market Insights\n\n### Price List\n\nView the latest price list for Mayfair Shyam.\n\n| Unit Type (Saleable) | Price\\* | Action |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2 BHK Apartment  617 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 1.60 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 3 BHK Apartment  874 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 2.27 Cr** | Check Availability |\n\n\\*Prices are indicative and subject to applicable charges and project terms.\n\n### Price Trends\n\nMayfair Shyam's average asking price is stable quarter-on-quarter, compared with Borivali West.\n\nSep 2025 — Jun 2026\n\n| Quarter | Mayfair Shyam | Borivali West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Jun 2026 | 31900 | 30900 |\n| Mar 2026 | 31950 | 31300 |\n| Dec 2025 | 0 | 30300 |\n| Sep 2025 | 30700 | 30350 |\n\n### Rentals\n\nMonthly Rent in Borivali West ranges from ₹ 22.1 K to ₹ 74.4 K with options available for STUDIO,1,2,3 BHK units\n\n| Configuration | In Mayfair Shyam | In Borivali West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK | - | ₹ 32.7 K |\n| 2 BHK | - | ₹ 45.5 K |\n| 3 BHK | - | ₹ 74.4 K |\n\n### Recent Updates\n\nGet the latest price and market updates for Mayfair Shyam.\n\n#### Mumbai's Water Stock at 95.97% with Seven Lakes Holding High Levels\n\nMumbai's water stock has reached 95.97%, with seven lakes maintaining high levels. This ensures a stable water supply for the city, though civic authorities continue to monitor reservoir levels and rainfall.\n\n#### MMRDA Presents Surplus Budget with Significant Allocation for Infrastructure\n\nMMRDA has presented a surplus budget of ₹48,072 crore, with 87% allocated to infrastructure projects, including roads, public transport, and urban development. A notable provision of ₹4,000 crore is earmarked for the development of Mumbai 3.0 New Town, aiming for planned urban expansion.\n\n#### BMC Budget Includes ₹6,475 Crore for Water Security Projects\n\nThe BMC's FY26-27 budget includes a substantial allocation of ₹6,475 crore for water security initiatives. This funding is designated for projects such as the Manori desalination plant (₹500 crore) and the Gargai project (₹437.51 crore), aimed at augmenting the city's water supply capacity.\n\n#### Mumbai-Pune Expressway 'Missing Link' Project Set for May 1 Inauguration, Promising Safer and Faster Travel\n\nThe highly anticipated 'Missing Link' project on the Mumbai-Pune Expressway is set to be inaugurated on May 1, significantly reducing travel time by approximately 30 minutes and enhancing safety. The 10.5-km stretch features tunnels and a bridge, bypassing the accident-prone Khandala Ghat. This infrastructure upgrade is expected to ease traffic congestion, improve travel safety.\n\n## Mayfair Shyam Floor Plans\n\n![Floor plan of 2 BHK 617 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Mayfair Shyam, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/mayfair-shyam-apartment-2-bhk-617sqft-20215318095332.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 1.60 Cr\n\n![Floor plan of 3 BHK 874 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Mayfair Shyam, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/mayfair-shyam-apartment-3-bhk-874sqft-20215418095440.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 2.27 Cr\n\n## Master Plan, Photos, Videos & Brochure of Mayfair Shyam\n\nExplore the master plan, project photos and walkthrough videos of Mayfair Shyam to understand the overall layout, tower placement, amenities, landscaped spaces and key highlights before making your buying decision.\n\nDownload master plan of Mayfair Shyam to explore layout details in Borivali West, Mumbai.\n\n### Master Plan\n\nOverall project layout & design\n\n### Walkthrough Video\n\nVirtual tour of the property\n\n## Amenities & Specifications of Mayfair Shyam\n\n### Sports Sports\n\n![Sports](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/sports/am-ico-kidsplay-active.svg)\n\n### Convenience Convenience\n\n![Convenience](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/convenience/am-ico-powerbac-active.svg)\n\n### Safety Safety\n\n![Safety](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/safety/am-ico-24x7secu-active.svg)\n\n### Specifications\n\n## Location and Connectivity Around Mayfair Housing Borivali West\n\n![Connectivity map showing nearby places around Mumbai Western Suburbs](/assets/images/project-map.png?aio=w-714;h-317;crop;)\n\nEstimate commute from your office or kid's school to Mayfair Shyam.\n\n![Car travel mode](/assets/images/car-fill.svg)\n![Mayfair Shyam](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/mayfair-shyam-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-112;h-96;crop;)\n\nPlease select the starting point to calculate the travel time.\n\n![Rolling loader icon](/assets/images/rolling-loader.gif)\n\n### Nearby Landmarks\n\n#### Gokhale Education Society Shishu Vikas Mandir\n\n#### Ganesh Mandir Kastur Park\n\n#### Seth Ent & Eye Hospital\n\n### Connecting Roads\n\nAverage Asking Price in Borivali West\n\nBased on active listings and recent trends\n\nWestern Express Highway & SV Road\n\nLimited social amenities and infrastructure\n\nBorivali West attracts me since my experiences feel subdued and balanced. Nearby markets daily and excellent schools are good. Weekend beach time and runs close to SGNP are something I like. Andheri and Goregaon are simple for me to work in. Parking problems and traffic jams call for quick solutions.\n\n— Suresh Sanghvi, Tenant\n\n## RERA Details of Mayfair Shyam\n\n## How does Mayfair Shyam compare with similar projects?\n\n![Mayfair Shyam project in Borivali West, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-mayfair-shyam-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Mayfair Shyam](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/mayfair-shyam/28139/project \"Mayfair Shyam\")\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n![Chandak Nishchay project in Borivali East, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-chandak-nishchay-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Chandak Nishchay](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/chandak-nishchay/10108/project \"Chandak Nishchay\")\n\nBorivali East, Mumbai\n\n![Mayfair Legends project in Malad West, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-mayfair-legends-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Mayfair Legends](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/mayfair-legends/27181/project \"Mayfair Legends\")\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\nSend one enquiry to all selected projects and compare up to 4 options side-by-side.\n\n## Mayfair Housing Track Record\n\n![Mayfair Housing logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/mayfair-housing-585.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n\nMayfair Housing Company is one of the most accelerating real estate developers and builders in the property development business. Headquartered in Mumbai, Mayfair Housing was founded in 1964 by the Late Shri Arvindbhai Shah and his wife, and since then, the company is engraving a legacy with 55+ years in the real estate industry. Mayfair Housing Developer has evolved over the years and uses contemporary development concepts and the latest technology to offer top-notch services to its customers. They are the leading real estate developers in Mumbai city with years of experience in offering a variety of residential and commercial projects in Mumbai, Maharashtra. \nWith a team of professionals, Mayfair Housing Real Estate Company is well-known for constructing and offering budget-friendly apartments in Mumbai. All properties by this developer are equipped with premium amenities and built as per international standards. Mayfair Housing Company focuses on meeting the thriving needs of better houses and commercial spaces. This housing construction company also focuses on building infrastructure for State and Central Governments. \nMayfair Housing Company was one of the early pioneers in identifying the potential of TDRs. All projects developed by this company are built with a keen eye for architectural design and quality. With a  diverse portfolio of real estate projects, the Mayfair Housing Developer aims at more consistency in terms of technical expertise, quality and service.\n\n![Mayfair Aranya residential project in Andheri West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-mayfair-aranya-project-flagship-opt-145d2e27-6f6f-4b4f-858c-b39b728cb2b5.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nAndheri West, Mumbai\n\n2, 3 BHK Apartment, Retail Shop\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![Mayfair Breeze residential project in Andheri West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-mayfair-breeze-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nAndheri West, Mumbai\n\n2, 3 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 2.29 Cr to 3.54 Cr\n\n![Mayfair Sheel Apartments residential project in Bandra West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-mayfair-sheel-apartments-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nBandra West, Mumbai\n\n3 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 10.55 Cr to 14.01 Cr\n\n![Mayfair Gnyanadeep residential project in Santacruz West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-mayfair-gnyanadeep-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nSantacruz West, Mumbai\n\n2, 3 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 4.93 Cr to 6.76 Cr\n\n![Mayfair Sardar Smruti CHS residential project in Borivali West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-mayfair-sardar-smruti-chs-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![Mayfair 14 residential project in Borivali West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-mayfair-14-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n2 BHK Retail Shop, Apartment\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![Mayfair Melody residential project in Santacruz West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-mayfair-melody-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nSantacruz West, Mumbai\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![Mayfair JVPD 1 residential project in Vile Parle West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-mayfair-jvpd-1-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nVile Parle West, Mumbai\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![Mayfair June Blossoms residential project in Bandra West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-mayfair-june-blossoms-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nBandra West, Mumbai\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![Mayfair Harish Kunj residential project in Santacruz West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-mayfair-harish-kunj-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nSantacruz West, Mumbai\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![Mayfair Enclave residential project in Khar We